getMatrix -- returns the Gram matrix of a stable or unstable Grothendieck-Witt class
************************************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        getMatrix(beta)
  * Inputs:
      * beta, a *note Grothendieck-Witt Class: GrothendieckWittClass,, a
        Grothendieck-Witt class
      * beta, an *note Unstable Grothendieck-Witt Class:
        UnstableGrothendieckWittClass,, an unstable Grothendieck-Witt class
  * Outputs:
      * a *note matrix: (Macaulay2Doc)Matrix,, the Gram matrix of the
        Grothendieck-Witt class or unstable Grothendieck-Witt class

Description
===========

Given a GrothendieckWittClass or UnstableGrothendieckWittClass object beta,
this method returns the Gram matrix of the Grothendieck-Witt class or unstable
Grothendieck-Witt class. The Gram matrix is a symmetric matrix over the algebra
of the Grothendieck-Witt class or unstable Grothendieck-Witt class.

+----------------------------------+
|i1 : M = matrix(QQ, {{0,1},{1,0}})|
|                                  |
|o1 = | 0 1 |                      |
|     | 1 0 |                      |
|                                  |
|              2       2           |
|o1 : Matrix QQ  <-- QQ            |
+----------------------------------+
|i2 : getMatrix makeGWClass M      |
|                                  |
|o2 = | 0 1 |                      |
|     | 1 0 |                      |
|                                  |
|              2       2           |
|o2 : Matrix QQ  <-- QQ            |
+----------------------------------+
|i3 : getMatrix makeGWuClass(M, -4)|
|                                  |
|o3 = | 0 1 |                      |
|     | 1 0 |                      |
|                                  |
|              2       2           |
|o3 : Matrix QQ  <-- QQ            |
+----------------------------------+

See also
========

  * *note GrothendieckWittClass: GrothendieckWittClass, -- a new type intended
    to capture the isomorphism class of an element of the Grothendieck-Witt
    ring of a field or finite étale algebras over a field
  * *note UnstableGrothendieckWittClass: UnstableGrothendieckWittClass, -- a
    new type intended to capture an element of the unstable Grothendieck-Witt
    group of a field or finite étale algebras over a field
  * *note getAlgebra: getAlgebra, -- returns the algebra over which a stable or
    unstable Grothendieck-Witt class is defined
  * *note getBaseField: getBaseField, -- returns the base field of a stable or
    unstable Grothendieck-Witt class
  * *note getScalar: getScalar, -- returns the non-zero scalar of an unstable
    Grothendieck-Witt class
  * *note makeGWClass: makeGWClass, -- the Grothendieck-Witt class of a
    symmetric matrix
  * *note makeGWuClass: makeGWuClass, -- constructor for unstable
    Grothendieck-Witt classes

Ways to use getMatrix:
======================

  * "getMatrix(GrothendieckWittClass)"
  * "getMatrix(UnstableGrothendieckWittClass)"

